# Template for apps/android/api-keys.properties (untracked, gitignored — never commit it).
# Copy this file to api-keys.properties, fill in your real keys, and deploy-local.sh
# will push it to the device, where ApiKeysStore reads it at runtime.
# Key rotation: replace the value here/in your local copy and re-push (see docs/conversation-engines.md).
ZHIPUAI_API_KEY=your-zhipuai-api-key-here
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-deepseek-api-key-here
